	(text "NOTES/TIPS:\n\n- please feel free to delete boxes/text and move things around. make the schematic your own!\n\n- the schematic ONLY indicates what is connected where; the layout is what describes\nphysical placement\n\n- the thing that looks like a mounting hole in the MicroMod footprint is a screw hole.\nthe actual microprocessor will be screwed down there and cover the entire footprint \ncourtyard with 1.9mm clearance beneath it. keep this in mind when doing layout."
